{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人深深喜欢着另一个人，享受彼此亲近的陪伴，却始终害怕这份感情不会长久，也不确定对方是否同样需要自己。他从小心隐藏、反复犹豫，到终于坦白喜欢，最后学着不再强求永远，只珍惜当下并勇敢表达。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\"sec\":\"S01\",\"caught\":\"心动却藏着喜欢\",\"echo\":\"\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S02\",\"caught\":\"亲近里仍然克制\",\"echo\":\"S01\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S03\",\"caught\":\"贪恋当下却难开口\",\"echo\":\"S02\",\"why\":\"勉强\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S04\",\"caught\":\"旧日沉默再次浮现\",\"echo\":\"S03\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S05\",\"caught\":\"告白后反而慌乱\",\"echo\":\"S04\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S06\",\"caught\":\"安心之下仍有孤独\",\"echo\":\"S05\",\"why\":\"勉强\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S07\",\"caught\":\"盼对方也需要陪伴\",\"echo\":\"S06\",\"why\":\"勉强\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S08\",\"caught\":\"试着轻松回应喜欢\",\"echo\":\"S07\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S09\",\"caught\":\"害怕不再被需要\",\"echo\":\"S07\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S10\",\"caught\":\"不猜以后只顾当下\",\"echo\":\"S09\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S11\",\"caught\":\"坦白喜欢却怕不对等\",\"echo\":\"S09\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S12\",\"caught\":\"明知无保证仍想付出\",\"echo\":\"S11\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S13\",\"caught\":\"幸福越真越怕失去\",\"echo\":\"S12\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S14\",\"caught\":\"不求永远也不再隐瞒\",\"echo\":\"S01\",\"why\":\"能\"}\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是S06、S07和S09到S13：情绪一直在亲近、孤独、渴望和害怕失去之间来回摆动，而且很多内容是在猜测对方的心意，不容易一下理清。最抓人的是S04到S05以及S12到S14，从一次次欲言又止，到终于说出喜欢，再到不强求永远而选择坦然表达，前后呼应很明显。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "302ee10b-5d6c-418e-bdb9-67a59ceaa165", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T185420857208Z", "elapsed_seconds": 31.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T18:54:52.439118+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2cb474908940caca11287ef9883b3335a3bd248009fac648e09ac09600a1e739", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T185420857208Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3933a0a243ddbf0cfce622d641cdc902065af26dcf38e0849e3bd836880225ad"}}}
